meta {
  name: quiz-service
}

docs {
  # quiz-service API Collection

  Module **M2** of the learning platform: A **1EdTech QTI v3.0 Question Bank & Scoring Engine**.
  
  ## Key Capabilities
  - **Item Bank**: Multiple-choice assessment items (single and multiple choice).
  - **Concept Linking**: Links items to curriculum nodes via `conceptUri` (CFItem identifier from M1 `opencase-service`).
  - **QTI v3.0 XML**: Imports and exports standard QTI 3.0 XML packages with `rptemplates/match_correct`.
  - **Test Assembly**: Groups items into modular test sections.
  - **Scoring & Outcomes**: Evaluates single or bulk attempts, computes mastery ratios per `conceptUri` for M5 `learner-model-service`.
  - **Privacy**: No PII stored; candidates are identified only by pseudonymous `candidateId` (OneRoster `sourcedId`).
}
